content.text:
Build succeeds now. Fixed `astro.config.mjs:12-17` — Starlight 0.39+ dropped support for `autogenerate` directly on a sidebar group; it now needs to be nested inside an `items` array:

```js
sidebar: [
  {
    label: 'A-CSM',
    items: [{ autogenerate: { directory: 'A-CSM' } }],
  },
],
```

Build completed cleanly (52 pages, search index built, no errors).

